---
globs: src/components/**/*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Component Standards

Prefer functional components.

Keep components focused and reasonably small.

Avoid giant multi-responsibility components.

---

# Props

Use explicit props.

Avoid excessive prop drilling.

Prefer composition when appropriate.

---

# Rendering

Prefer early returns over nested ternaries.

Keep JSX readable.

Extract repeated UI patterns into smaller components.

---

# State

Keep local component state minimal.

Do not duplicate global or server state locally.

---

# Side Effects

Use useEffect intentionally.

Avoid unnecessary effects.

Do not use effects for logic that can run during render.

---

# Accessibility

Prefer semantic HTML.

Use:
- labels
- buttons
- form semantics
- aria attributes

when appropriate.

---

# Event Handlers

Use descriptive handler names:
- handleSubmit
- handleDelete
- handleSelect

Avoid inline complex logic inside JSX.